{
  "id": "28",
  "title": "HTMX + Prism",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12) 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B82F6\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon 重新定義了 <strong>超媒體驅動架構 (HDA)</strong>。通過將 <strong>HTMX</strong> 與 <strong>Prism</strong> 引擎融合，您可以使用純伺服器渲染的片段實現高保真的互動體驗。</p></div><h2>HDA 的演進</h2><p>傳統的 SPA 飽受狀態同步之苦。Photon 的 HTMX 堆棧通過將真實來源 (Source of Truth) 保留在伺服器端，同時直接向瀏覽器交付極速的 DOM 增量更新，從而解決了這一難題。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(59,130,246,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">統一邏輯</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">驗證、授權與業務邏輯保留在它們所屬的地方：伺服器端。實現零客戶端程式碼重疊。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(59,130,246,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"/><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">SSR 片段</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Prism 的微緩衝機制允許在 1ms 內渲染局部片段，帶來即時的 UI 響應速度。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(59,130,246,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 4 23 10 17 10\"/><path d=\"M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">自動調度</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">內建的 <code>htmxMiddleware</code> 可自動處理請求檢測與內容替換，減少 70% 的樣板程式碼。</p></div></div><h2>調度通訊協定</h2><p>請求檢測在引擎層級處理。通過檢查 <code>HX-Request</code> 標頭，Photon 會決定是渲染完整的佈局，還是針對性的原子化片段。</p><pre><code>import { Photon, htmxMiddleware } from '@gravito/photon'\n\nconst app = new Photon()\napp.use(htmxMiddleware())\n\napp.get('/search', async (c) => {\n  const query = c.req.query('q')\n  const view = c.get('view')\n  \n  const results = await db.search(query)\n\n  // 原子化內容替換檢測\n  if (c.get('htmx')) {\n    return c.html(view.render('partials/results', { results }))\n  }\n  \n  return c.html(view.render('pages/search', { results }))\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #3B82F6; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 系統日誌：超媒體策略</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">利用 <strong>Hx-Push-Url</strong>，Photon 即使在渲染片段時也能同步更新瀏覽器歷史記錄，確保返回按鈕與深層連結的運作與傳統 SPA 完全一致，但減少了 90% 的 JavaScript 開銷。</p></div><h2>效能差異</h2><p>標準 JSON 客戶端渲染與 Photon HDA 片段之間的負載效率數據視覺化。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_HDA_FRAGMENT</span> <span>1.2KB</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 15%; background: #3B82F6; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(59,130,246,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>CLIENT_SIDE_HYDRATION (BUNDLE + JSON)</span> <span>145.8KB</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 大幅降低初始 JavaScript 執行的線程阻塞時間</p></div><h2>Prism 局部模板模式</h2><p>利用 Prism 中的 <code>@include</code> 與 <code>@component</code> 指令來建立可重用的 UI 片段。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">搜尋觸發器</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>&lt;input type=\"text\"\n       name=\"q\"\n       hx-get=\"/search\"\n       hx-trigger=\"keyup delay:500ms\"\n       hx-target=\"#results\"\n       hx-indicator=\".spinner\" /&gt;</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">結果片段</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>@each results as item\n  &lt;div class=\"card shadow-sm\"&gt;\n    &lt;h3&gt;{{ item.title }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n    &lt;button hx-delete=\"/post/{{item.id}}\"&gt;\n      刪除\n    &lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n@endeach</code></pre></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 184, 148, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #00b894; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>專業建議：</strong> 在父容器使用 <code>hx-boost=\"true\"</code>，可自動將所有標準連結與表單轉換為 AJAX 請求，無需編寫任何 JavaScript 即可將您的網站立即轉變為 SPA。</p></div>",
